        "id": 10935,
        "name": "fearothwow",
        "username": "fearothwow",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/8491ac/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-13T22:31:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just finished my first game of Tactics and really enjoyed it, but a few rules need some clerification.</p><p>1. Hazard tiles</p><p>Do hazard tiles affect structures, example the pylons in Blade 3, if a hazard tile, such as Zero's impaling structors card and they are placed on the pylons, do the pylons get hit and if so when, at the end of blades turn?</p><p>Also How long do player created hazards last?</p><p>2. Player slows</p><p>How long do player institutied slows last, the way I played it was it affected 1 movment and moved on.</p><p>3. Radius effects</p><p>How do aoe raduis work, do they have to have a line of sight of the target from the origin point?</p><p>4. Blade scenario 2</p><p>How do you end blade 2? The objective is to set &nbsp;up as many structors as possible, but does it move on if all structors die or if he dies?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:07.276Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 3,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 15.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 10933,
        "topic_slug": "few-rule-questions",
        "display_username": "fearothwow",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
