        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I just finished my first game of Tactics and really enjoyed it, but a few rules need some clerification.</p><p>1. Hazard tiles</p><p>Do hazard tiles affect structures, example the pylons in Blade 3, if a hazard tile, such as Zero&#39;s impaling structors card and they are placed on the pylons, do the pylons get hit and if so when, at the end of blades turn?</p><p>Also How long do player created hazards last?</p><p>2. Player slows</p><p>How long do player institutied slows last, the way I played it was it affected 1 movment and moved on.</p><p>3. Radius effects</p><p>How do aoe raduis work, do they have to have a line of sight of the target from the origin point?</p><p>4. Blade scenario 2</p><p>How do you end blade 2? The objective is to set &nbsp;up as many structors as possible, but does it move on if all structors die or if he dies?</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 5641,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 1,
        "deleted_at": null,
        "user_deleted": false,
        "edit_reason": null,
        "can_view_edit_history": true,
        "wiki": false,
        "can_accept_answer": false,
        "can_unaccept_answer": false,
        "accepted_answer": false,
        "topic_accepted_answer": false
      },
      {
        "id": 114196,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-13T22:35:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1a. No, Pylons do not have a turn, so are not able to end their turn on a hazard space, thus immune.</p><p>1b. Player created hazards last until the card that created is removed.</p><p>2. Just the 1 movement, the character goes back to normal after that.</p><p>3.Yes they need LoS, unless otherwise stated.</p><p>4. In the setup, the last sentence. It has you make a pile of 5 Scenario Markers, at the end of every round you remove 1. After the last 1 is removed, the match ends.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:46:02.235Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
