        "created_at": "2014-08-13T22:39:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for fast response, as for 3, is line of sight a stright line?&nbsp;</p><p>More specifically Zero's thermal shockwave. With freezing field active, it has a radius of 3, is that 3 in a line or anything around him that is 3 ajacent tiles away?</p>",
