      {
        "id": 114198,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-13T22:43:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"fearothwow\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/8491ac/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fearothwow:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks for fast response, as for 3, is line of sight a stright line?&nbsp;More specifically Zero's thermal shockwave. With freezing field active, it has a radius of 3, is that 3 in a line or anything around him that is 3 ajacent tiles away?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Anything in the 3 hexes away, as long as they have LoS. Say AZ and Blade are 2 hexes away from eachother on Elevation 1, if there is an elevation 2 in between them, then AZ cannot hit Blade with Thermal Shockwave.</p>\n<p>And just incase you missed the edit, I answered the other questions in my previous post now.</p>",
