        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"fearothwow\"]\n\nThanks for fast response, as for 3, is line of sight a stright line?&nbsp;More specifically Zero&#39;s thermal shockwave. With freezing field active, it has a radius of 3, is that 3 in a line or anything around him that is 3 ajacent tiles away?\n\n[/quote]\n\nAnything in the 3 hexes away, as long as they have LoS. Say AZ and Blade are 2 hexes away from eachother on Elevation 1, if there is an elevation 2 in between them, then AZ cannot hit Blade with Thermal Shockwave.\n\nAnd just incase you missed the edit, I answered the other questions in my previous post now.\n",
