        "created_at": "2014-08-13T22:52:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>All reach does is allow you to check as if the target is closer. If a target is at range 3, then AZ's then dice rolling 1+&nbsp;will not be removed for not making range. If the target is at range 4, then rolls of 2+ will not be removed for not making range.</p><p>It does not increase the radius of Thermal Shockwave.</p>",
